# --- 5. 📧 Gmail SMTP & Automated Email Delivery ---
# How to get your 16-character Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Enable "2-Step Verification" if not already enabled
# 3. Search or go to "App Passwords" (https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
# 4. App name: "NamoGPT", click Create
# 5. Copy the 16-letter password (e.g., "abcd efgh ijkl mnop") and paste below
